can I have lunch with you today?

00:14:24.624 --> 00:14:27.224
Senior! Please eat this lunch!

00:14:28.064 --> 00:14:29.134
Oww...

00:14:29.134 --> 00:14:31.994
That hurt! Don't jump out of nowhere like that!

00:14:32.434 --> 00:14:35.874
Huh? I just heard familiar voices...

00:14:36.934 --> 00:14:39.674
Big Brother looks forward to
MY lunchbox every day!

00:14:39.674 --> 00:14:41.144
So don't do anything unnecessary!

00:14:43.114 --> 00:14:47.544
There's no rule in the student council charter
saying that I can't make lunch for Yoshikawa!

00:14:47.754 --> 00:14:51.454
It's Haruo who's going to eat it!
Why don't we just let him pick?

00:14:51.454 --> 00:14:54.854
I tried really hard to make this just for him!

00:14:54.854 --> 00:14:56.514
Hold it right there!

00:14:56.954 --> 00:14:59.564
There's something suspicious
about your lunch boxes.

00:14:59.564 --> 00:15:00.524
Gulp!

00:15:00.664 --> 00:15:02.764
I'll taste it for him first.

00:15:02.764 --> 00:15:06.204
And I don't mind him picking the one
he wants afterwards!

00:15:06.204 --> 00:15:07.434
If it's just a little bit she shouldn't notice...

00:15:07.434 --> 00:15:10.204
Beep bee-beep bee-beep bee-beep!
If it's just a little bit she shouldn't notice...

00:15:10.204 --> 00:15:12.874
I'll taste them, too!

00:15:13.804 --> 00:15:15.204
Me, too!

00:15:20.144 --> 00:15:22.344
From the outside they don't look suspicious...

00:15:22.414 --> 00:15:24.884
Look at them... They must've gone all out on these.

00:15:24.884 --> 00:15:28.154
Ayumi in particular knows what Big Brother likes.

00:15:28.254 --> 00:15:30.724
Does mine look too ordinary?
But lunch boxes are all about taste!

00:15:35.664 --> 00:15:38.464
It needs a little more seasoning, but it's not bad...

00:15:38.464 --> 00:15:41.134
Yuri's egg omelet has a nice flavor to it...

00:15:41.134 --> 00:15:42.434
Hey, it's pretty good...

00:15:42.434 --> 00:15:45.104
Hmm... So he likes this kind of seasoning, huh?

00:15:45.244 --> 00:15:47.774
I guess I don't see any problem with the food...

00:15:47.774 --> 00:15:49.764
Well then...

00:15:50.644 --> 00:15:52.344
First come, first served!

00:15:53.214 --> 00:15:54.704
Hey, wait!

00:15:58.684 --> 00:15:59.424
I said wait!

00:15:59.424 --> 00:16:01.094
What are you doing?

00:16:01.094 --> 00:16:02.994
You grabbed my clothes! That's not fair!

00:16:02.994 --> 00:16:05.354
You fool! Take a good look at yourself!

00:16:05.664 --> 00:16:07.654
Look at myself?

00:16:08.664 --> 00:16:10.024
Huh?

00:16:10.664 --> 00:16:12.464
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:12.464 --> 00:16:14.434
My body shrank!

00:16:14.434 --> 00:16:18.104
It looks like all of us cast magic on the food...

00:16:18.104 --> 00:16:21.564
Let's be honest and each one of us
say what kind of magic we cast.

00:16:21.774 --> 00:16:24.004
I cast physical strengthening magic.

00:16:24.244 --> 00:16:26.884
I cast a counter spell as part of my
anti-Ayumi measures.

00:16:26.884 --> 00:16:30.444
I cast growth-accelerating magic
for stimulating his magical power.

00:16:31.554 --> 00:16:33.824
So you DID cast fishy magic on his food!

00:16:33.824 --> 00:16:36.094
And what you did isn't so different!

00:16:36.094 --> 00:16:40.364
Basically, Mamiya's growth-acceleration spell
was enhanced by my magic.

00:16:40.364 --> 00:16:42.094
But because of Yoshikawa's sister's magic,

00:16:42.094 --> 00:16:46.034
the effect was reversed and our
ages have regressed.

00:16:46.034 --> 00:16:47.904
What? Is that what happened?

00:16:47.904 --> 00:16:49.574
I don't really understand what's going on,

00:16:49.574 --> 00:16:51.744
but basically we're getting younger, huh?

00:16:51.744 --> 00:16:55.174
At any rate, we have to cancel the magic!

00:16:55.174 --> 00:17:00.414
If we cast the counter spell on everyone's
lunch boxes and eat, the magic should be canceled.

00:17:00.784 --> 00:17:01.784
You're right!

00:17:01.784 --> 00:17:02.914
Well then!

00:17:11.564 --> 00:17:13.584
It didn't cancel the magic!

00:17:14.034 --> 00:17:15.584
What does it mean?

00:17:17.834 --> 00:17:22.004
Nijihara's lunchbox must've been
enchanted with some kind of magic!

00:17:22.004 --> 00:17:25.094
And that must be interfering
with the counter spell!

00:17:25.174 --> 00:17:26.574
Where is she?

00:17:26.574 --> 00:17:29.274
She took off running somewhere!

00:17:29.274 --> 00:17:30.844
Th-This isn't good!

00:17:30.844 --> 00:17:34.744
At this rate, we'll keep on regressing to before
we were born and eventually disappear!

00:17:34.954 --> 00:17:37.914
We must find Nijihara no matter what!

00:17:37.984 --> 00:17:39.954
Hey, Vice-President! Umi!

00:17:41.094 --> 00:17:44.264
Hey! Have you seen a kid like us pass by here?

00:17:44.264 --> 00:17:47.634
Y-Yeah. I saw her running that way earlier...

00:17:47.634 --> 00:17:48.934
Okay, thanks!

00:17:48.934 --> 00:17:51.334
She's so cute! I wonder if she's
Miss Yuri's little sister.

00:17:51.334 --> 00:17:51.834
Home Economics Room
She's so cute! I wonder if she's
Miss Yuri's little sister.

00:17:51.834 --> 00:17:53.304
Home Economics Room

00:17:53.864 --> 00:17:57.004
You just gotta have hot tea to go with a lunchbox!

00:17:57.004 --> 00:17:59.134
I'm sure he'll be delighted!

00:17:59.774 --> 00:18:03.474
Huh? For some reason it seems like the table
is slightly higher... wonder why...

00:18:04.414 --> 00:18:06.444
Nijihara! So you were in here!

00:18:06.444 --> 00:18:08.314
Are you trying to interfere with me again?

00:18:08.784 --> 00:18:09.884
What are you talking about?

00:18:09.884 --> 00:18:12.144
You have to look at yourself in the mirror!

00:18:13.924 --> 00:18:15.684
I'm smaller!

00:18:16.554 --> 00:18:19.394
You must've put a curse on me!

00:18:19.394 --> 00:18:22.664
I didn't mean to curse anyone!

00:18:22.664 --> 00:18:25.634
Anyway, go ahead and eat this!

00:18:28.834 --> 00:18:32.274
We just need your lunchbox to complete it.

00:18:32.274 --> 00:18:33.474
Give it to me now!

00:18:33.474 --> 00:18:35.414
If I give it to you, then what?

00:18:35.944 --> 00:18:37.444
We're going to eat it.

00:18:37.444 --> 00:18:38.714
Eat it?

00:18:38.714 --> 00:18:40.614
That must've been your objective all along!

00:18:40.614 --> 00:18:42.314
I'm not gonna let you fool me!

00:18:42.384 --> 00:18:45.754
Hey, wait!

00:18:46.184 --> 00:18:47.254
Now that it's come to this,

00:18:47.254 --> 00:18:49.594
I'm gonna have to put forth my final effort
to give this lunch to him,

00:18:49.594 --> 00:18:52.094
and have him exterminate that evil witch!

00:18:52.094 --> 00:18:54.664
If you don't hurry up, you'll be in danger, too!

00:18:54.664 --> 00:18:55.194
That's a lie! That's a lie!
If you don't hurry up, you'll be in danger, too!

00:18:55.194 --> 00:18:56.724
That's a lie! That's a lie!

00:18:57.134 --> 00:19:00.004
Huh? My underwear is getting baggy
for some reason!

00:19:00.234 --> 00:19:03.034
My body is getting smaller and smaller!

00:19:03.034 --> 00:19:05.504
I don't care, I don't need clothes!

00:19:11.944 --> 00:19:13.484
We got you!

00:19:13.484 --> 00:19:15.614
You sure gave us a lot of trouble!

00:19:15.614 --> 00:19:17.954
Hurry up and cast the counter spell!

00:19:17.954 --> 00:19:19.474
I know that!

00:19:19.824 --> 00:19:21.894
So you guys are witches, too!

00:19:21.894 --> 00:19:23.184
Yeah, so what?

00:19:24.054 --> 00:19:26.224
If you're going to make me
give this to you, I'd rather...

00:19:34.064 --> 00:19:36.064
In the pond?!

00:19:36.134 --> 00:19:37.774
What did you do that for?!

00:19:37.774 --> 00:19:41.004
I'd rather throw it away than let you guys eat it!

00:19:41.914 --> 00:19:44.574
YOU! Do you realize what you've just done?!

00:19:45.014 --> 00:19:47.004
This is the end!

00:19:49.014 --> 00:19:52.114
At this rate we're going to disappear!

00:19:52.784 --> 00:19:56.514
It's odd... It bothers me how easily
she threw it away...

00:19:56.994 --> 00:19:58.484
Oh, yeah! She's got us!

00:19:59.564 --> 00:20:02.564
I figured something like this might happen,
so I made rice balls ahead of time!

00:20:02.564 --> 00:20:04.394
This is my last hope!

00:20:05.764 --> 00:20:08.234
Senior! Yoshikawa!

00:20:08.674 --> 00:20:11.234
Please eat this rice ball for me!

00:20:11.344 --> 00:20:13.304
Are you Nijihara's little sister?

00:20:13.574 --> 00:20:17.874
Please! I'm begging you!
Please eat this rice ball!

00:20:18.614 --> 00:20:20.384
I just have to eat this?

00:20:20.384 --> 00:20:21.474
Yes!

00:20:23.884 --> 00:20:26.444
Hold on a second!

00:20:35.434 --> 00:20:38.164
Stupid! Why did you eat it?

00:20:38.164 --> 00:20:39.734
It's all over...
Stupid! Why did you eat it?

00:20:39.734 --> 00:20:41.634
Huh? What is it?

00:20:42.874 --> 00:20:44.804
Are you guys from the
kindergarten department?

00:20:44.804 --> 00:20:49.844
I'm so glad to be of help to you at last...

00:20:49.844 --> 00:20:51.364
Hey, you!

00:20:52.284 --> 00:20:53.714
Are you okay?

00:20:54.044 --> 00:20:55.714
This is serious!

00:20:55.714 --> 00:20:59.174
This is serious for us, too!

00:20:59.554 --> 00:21:01.314
Water...

00:21:01.524 --> 00:21:04.014
Water? You want some water?

00:21:04.294 --> 00:21:05.884
Let's see...

00:21:08.134 --> 00:21:10.294
Here, drink this!

00:21:14.974 --> 00:21:17.264
Wh-What's going on?!

00:21:18.204 --> 00:21:20.434
I see! Magic is cast on the tea, too!

00:21:26.784 --> 00:21:29.774
We did it! We're back to normal!

00:21:34.084 --> 00:21:34.854
What the hell are you looking at?

00:21:34.854 --> 00:21:35.454
Don't look!
What the hell are you looking at?

00:21:35.454 --> 00:21:36.894
Don't you dare look!
Don't look!
What the hell are you looking at?

00:21:40.164 --> 00:21:46.234
Oh, no! Haruo was so close to being
awakened as a man just now!

00:21:46.234 --> 00:21:48.304
I totally messed up!

00:21:48.304 --> 00:21:52.404
This never would've happened if you hadn't come
up with such a crazy idea in the first place, Ayumi!

00:21:52.644 --> 00:21:56.014
Oh, shut up! I'm not the only one who's
responsible for this incident!

00:21:56.014 --> 00:21:58.574
I'll definitely give him the lunchbox next time!

00:22:01.514 --> 00:22:02.914
Senior...

00:22:02.914 --> 00:22:06.474
I'm going to make a lunchbox that's
even more delicious tomorrow!

00:22:10.254 --> 00:22:13.254
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.734 --> 00:22:26.174
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:26.174 --> 00:22:32.384
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.384 --> 00:22:35.854
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:35.854 --> 00:22:38.924
But so what? So what?

00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:42.024
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:42.024 --> 00:22:45.394
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:45.394 --> 00:22:48.394
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:48.394 --> 00:22:51.764
Because you are precious to me

00:22:51.764 --> 00:22:58.224
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:59.774 --> 00:23:02.944
I don't want magic to be

00:23:02.944 --> 00:23:06.084
The reason why it's this way

00:23:06.084 --> 00:23:12.624
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:12.624 --> 00:23:19.024
Who are you in love with?

00:23:19.024 --> 00:23:25.164
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:25.434 --> 00:23:28.504
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:28.504 --> 00:23:30.094
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:37.074 --> 00:23:41.844
Someone attacks Yoshikawa at a roped-off
swimming pool, and steals what's inside of him!

00:23:42.414 --> 00:23:44.854
The attacker turns out to be a ghost
that resides in the pool!

00:23:44.854 --> 00:23:48.254
Hang on, Yoshikawa!
We promise we'll rescue you!

00:23:49.094 --> 00:23:52.594
Um, are you asking me to
wear a swimsuit like THIS?!

00:23:52.594 --> 00:23:55.724
Does that really have anything
to do with ghost extermination?!

00:23:56.464 --> 00:23:59.834
Next time on Magikano:
"Magi? There's a Ghost?"

00:24:00.364 --> 00:24:03.094
Something will go down beyond Magikano...
